      <description><![CDATA[<p>With a dull sound, Ning Yao caught a dragon scale that nearly brushed her face. Feng Jingzhuo grabbed one too. He flicked his wrist. The scale shot into the cliff wall with a “pop,” leaving only half of it sticking out. Ning Yao copied him, and her scale landed just above his. That was good.&hellip;</p>]]></description>
